<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;color:#004d99;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0;">Hi {{first_name}}, someone (hopefully you) asked to reset your password for the Friends' admin pages.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:22px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#004d99;border-radius:6px;">
      <a href="{{link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;">Choose a new password</a>
