<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">The button works once, for {{hours}} hours.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Didn't ask for this? You can ignore this email. Your password stays the same, and nobody can change it without this link.</p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5b6577;">If the button doesn't work, copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="{{link}}" style="color:#004d99;word-break:break-all;">{{link}}</a></p>
